%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e630dc122e0f84120853211c2139b372, type: 3}
  m_Name: MainQuest_notStarted
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueAsset
  npcAvatar: {fileID: 0}
  npcName: Pastor
  nodes:
  - id: mainquest_start
    text: You proved yourself to be a great help with our little problem. I know
      you came to us just a short time ago, but now that I know that you are capable
      of sailing these waters I want to entrust you with a special task...
    choices:
    - label: I'm listening
      nextNodeID: mainquest_todo
      actionsOnChoose: []
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    actionsOnEnter: []
    wwiseEvent:
      idInternal: 0
      valueGuidInternal: 
      WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - id: mainquest_todo
    text: You might have heard that a while ago our great religious leader has perished
      at sea. His wreck yet to be found. Aboard of it was the HOLY RADIO. And with
      the ship and the pope it's lost at sea. I need you to retrieve it for us. The
      new pope urgently needs it.
    choices:
    - label: What is this holy radio?
      nextNodeID: mainquest_expl
      actionsOnChoose: []
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - label: Another Quest??
      nextNodeID: mainquest_help
      actionsOnChoose: []
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    actionsOnEnter: []
    wwiseEvent:
      idInternal: 0
      valueGuidInternal: 
      WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - id: mainquest_expl
    text: It's classified information, that only few know about. Even I don't know
      the whole truth. I belive it has to do with getting in contact with... god
    choices:
    - label: Alright, I'll do it
      nextNodeID: mainquest_promise
      actionsOnChoose: []
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - label: Sounds like I won't do it for free
      nextNodeID: mainquest_help
      actionsOnChoose: []
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    actionsOnEnter: []
    wwiseEvent:
      idInternal: 0
      valueGuidInternal: 
      WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - id: mainquest_help
    text: I know that is a lot to take in.. but we cannot entrust anyone else at
      the moment with this task, a huge battle in the north east scared off many
      sailors of these waters... Please help us. We won't leave you without a reward
      of course!
    choices:
    - label: Alright, I'll do it
      nextNodeID: mainquest_promise
      actionsOnChoose: []
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - label: I'll think about it
      nextNodeID: mainquest_pls
      actionsOnChoose: []
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    actionsOnEnter: []
    wwiseEvent:
      idInternal: 0
      valueGuidInternal: 
      WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - id: mainquest_pls
    text: Come back soon. The world needs you!
    choices:
    - label: Leave
      nextNodeID: 
      actionsOnChoose:
      - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e042ea431fc0410ab65ad4e53a6af14, type: 2}
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    actionsOnEnter: []
    wwiseEvent:
      idInternal: 0
      valueGuidInternal: 
      WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - id: mainquest_promise
    text: 'Thank you! here are all the informations that I have:

      The ship
      was last seen north of this island, close to Fortress City. That is also nearby
      the place where a big battle took place a while ago. Maybe these things are
      intertwined. Good Luck'
    choices:
    - label: Leave
      nextNodeID: 
      actionsOnChoose:
      - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e042ea431fc0410ab65ad4e53a6af14, type: 2}
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    actionsOnEnter:
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1c496fa2c424442ce834a4c5082959a8, type: 2}
    wwiseEvent:
      idInternal: 0
      valueGuidInternal: 
      WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
  startNodeID: mainquest_start
